	(text "Thermo Couple K Type Voltage Range\n(https://www.thermocoupleinfo.com/type-k-thermocouple.htm)\n[-7 mV,	60 mV] conservatively approximated\n\nExtend range by ~10% each side\n[-14 mV, 67 mV] -> 81 mV Voltage swing.\n\n81 mV * A = 3.3 V\nA = 40.7407"
